usage: capture_treasury_auction_observations.py [-h] --data-dir DATA_DIR
                                                [--source {announced,upcoming,tentative,pending}]

One attended capture into Macro's existing Treasury auction data owner. No
imports fetch data. No scheduler, collector registration or feed publication
is installed by this command. Body receipt, publication and build clocks are
distinct.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --data-dir DATA_DIR   Existing Macro data root, or an explicitly isolated
                        verification root
  --source {announced,upcoming,tentative,pending}
